@startuml
title Tao ma moi va ket noi nguoi than
autonumber
actor "Chu ho so" as Owner
actor "Nguoi than" as Relative
participant "Web M07" as Web
participant "Express API" as API
participant "familyRouter" as Family
database "MongoDB" as DB
Owner -> Web : Chon Tao ma moi
Web -> API : POST /api/v1/family/invites
API -> Family : Xac minh token va gioi han tao ma
Family -> DB : Thu hoi ma pending cu
Family -> Family : Tao ma 6 so, bam SHA-256, han 15 phut
Family -> DB : Luu code_hash + expires_at + audit log
API --> Web : Ma hien thi mot lan + expiresAt
Relative -> Web : Nhap ma
Web -> API : POST /api/v1/family/invites/{code}/accept
API -> Family : Kiem tra dinh dang, hash, trang thai, han
Family -> DB : Tim invite va kiem tra khong tu ket noi
alt Ma khong hop le / het han / da dung
  API --> Web : 400/404/409
else Ma hop le
  Family -> DB : Tao connection active voi permissions mac dinh
  Family -> DB : Danh dau invite accepted + audit log
  API --> Web : 201 connection + permissions
end
note over Family,DB
Ma moi co han 15 phut va chi luu hash.
Quyen duoc kiem tra lai o backend moi request.
end note
@enduml
